MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Esm_m01_001: Hey, Sweetie? What's the story with Fabio? Why do\nyou stick with him?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Esm_m01_004: It can't just be because you're both from Fódlan.\nCan it?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Esm_m01_002: I guess you must just get along. Though I don't really\nsee what you have in common.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Esm_m01_003: Honestly, I don't really understand either of you\ntoo well.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c05_Esm_m01: <BLN>What's the story with Fabio?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01_001: Dagda really is quite markedly different from Fódlan.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01_002: Whether you are speaking in terms of size, climate,\nplant life, culture, government, or religion.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01_003: Take, for example, the goddess. In Fódlan, she is all\nbut an abstract. Here, the gods are vividly real.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01_004: They live among the people and govern the\nempire itself.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01_005: They even wield power over its vassal states by\nallowing them a measure of self-governance.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01_006: Though it is not unlike other polytheistic societies\nthat have arisen in the past, to be sure.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c05_Fab_m01: <BLN>This land of Dagda is so different.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Mic_m01_001: You're all...how should I put this? Weird.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Mic_m01_002: I guess it's not too surprising, given that two of you\ncome from across the sea.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Mic_m01_003: And what's weird about Esmeralda is that she's a\nnormal local girl just tagging along.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_Mic_m01_004: Still, you pay me well, so I can't complain.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c05_Mic_m01: <BLN>Strange indeed.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B01_m01_001: I saw your match. I was on the edge of my seat!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B01_m01_002: The way you cut that runaway chariot clean in two...\nThere are no words!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B01_m01_003: Keep up stunts like that and you've got a fan for life!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c05_B01_m01: <BLN>Incredible!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B02_m01_001: I've got something for you...i-if you'd accept it.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B02_m01_002: Your fighting is so graceful, yet so brutal...so elegant,\nyet so unrestrained...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c05_B02_m01_003: It's all too much, really. I will support your\ncontinued success!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c05_B02_m01: <BLN>Would you accept this?